  "content_id": "16136154",
  "title": "Rango Exchange – Exchange Integration in Edge Wallet",
  "description": "Type: Decentralized Exchange (DEX) Does not have limits or require Know Your Customer (KYC)\nOverview: Rango Exchange is a cross-chain DEX ...",
  "body": "<p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Type:</b> Decentralized Exchange (DEX) Does not have limits or require Know Your Customer (KYC)</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Overview:</b> Rango Exchange is a cross-chain DEX aggregator that supports swaps across more than 60 blockchains. It integrates bridges, aggregators, and DEXs to deliver highly optimized and versatile swapping routes.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSFNDYWX1WJ74SF1KGNTV3FW\">How to Manage Exchange Settings in Edge</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">To access your exchange settings in Edge Wallet:</p><ol><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap the <b>three lines</b> in the upper right-hand corner</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap on <b>Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Tap <b>Exchange Settings</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\">Here, you can turn exchange partners <b>on or off</b>, and customize your preferences. When multiple exchanges can fill an order, you can also choose to automatically select the best price or prioritize a preferred exchange.</p></li></ol><hr>",
